    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "## Problem\n\n`mintswarm-github` does not build on its own: `cargo build -p mintswarm-github` (or `cargo test -p mintswarm-github` run alone) fails on `tokio::join!` in `crates/github/src/key_store.rs`, because the crate's `tokio` dependency does not enable the `macros` feature. A full-workspace build hides this, since another member turns `macros` on and Cargo unifies features, so the gates and CI never see it. The #597 reviewer hit it when building the crate alone.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- `cargo build -p mintswarm-github` and `cargo test -p mintswarm-github --no-run` succeed when run on their own, from a clean target directory.\n- `crates/github/Cargo.toml` enables exactly the tokio features the crate's own code uses.\n",
